{"version":1,"content":"<p>從零開始開發一個作業系統內核，通常需要一支經驗豐富的工程師團隊耗費數年時間。然而，CentOS聯合創始人、Rocky Linux項目發起者Gregory Kurtzer近日展示了一項頗為特別的成果：他利用人工智能代理，僅用11天便打造出一個全新的作業系統內核Ginux。這個內核沒有使用任何Linux內核代碼，卻已經能夠啓動Rocky Linux 10。儘管目前仍屬於研究原型，但這一項目展示了AI參與複雜底層軟件開發的全新可能。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584866.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:43:03.214121+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":220,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:38:27.495608+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:38:27.495608+00:00","content_hash":"c76a477663a038b870e0d9102f792592075ac71c25d6d812c4f95029ddfb052c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}